# Filament publishes its CSS, JS and fonts here, and composer republishes them
# on every install via `filament:upgrade`. Committing them means git holds a
# copy that silently goes stale when Filament is upgraded — the panel then
# renders unstyled while still returning 200. Application assets go through
# Vite into /public/build, so nothing hand-written lives in these directories.
/public/css
/public/js
/public/fonts
/storage/*.key
/storage/pail
/vendor
Homestead.json
Homestead.yaml
Thumbs.db
